<title>FRANCE: Rouen Nov 1-6 flour exports 20,016 T,all for Yemen.</title>
<headline>Rouen Nov 1-6 flour exports 20,016 T,all for Yemen.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from Rouen reached 20,016 tonnes between November 1 and November 6, port officials said.</p>
<p>The flour was destined for Yemen, they said.</p>
<p>Flour exports reached a total of 31,000 tonnes in November 1995. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
